.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-task-phase 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-task\-phase \- Record what a registered task is now doing
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten task phase\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpid\fR> <\fIvalue\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record what a registered task is now doing
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpid\fR>
The process the record is keyed by
.TP
<\fIvalue\fR>
The value to record; its stamp moves only when it changes
